ailability in Europe and China will be delayed due to regulatory issues. The move comes as Apple transitions to a new CEO, with Tim Ternus taking over from Steve Cook.\n\nID: 4172937\nCREATED: 2026-06-08\nDOMAIN: boston25news.com\nSLUG: bpgyszeydi6vdjby4jyb4zchju\nTEXT: Apple unveiled new AI features at its annual conference, including upgrades to its Siri voice assistant. CEO Tim Cook emphasized a focus on privacy and day-to-day use, aiming to catch up with rivals in AI.\n\n\n',)
