etadata field is not consistent, set it to null.\n   - Metadata keys:\n       - location\n       - subject_matter\n       - industry\n       - time  (represents WHEN the event occurred, not when published)\n\nReturn ONLY a JSON object with this structure:\n\n{\n  "subject": "...",\n  "predicate": "...",\n  "object": "...",\n  "metadata": {\n    "location": "... or null",\n    "subject_matter": "... or null",\n    "industry": "... or null",\n    "time": "... or null"\n  }\n}\n\nHere are the RawRecords:\n\nID: 4173365\nCREATED: 2026-06-08\nDOMAIN: techradar.com\nSLUG: quordle-today-answers-clues-9-june-2026\nTEXT: Quordle Daily Sequence game #1597 answers are AUDITBASICDRAMAWAVER. The sequence for game #1596 was CURSE, DROVE, SNOWY, DEBUG. For game #1595, the sequence was QUERY, AXION, LILAC, SWORD.\n\nID: 4176380\nCREATED: 2026-06-10\nDOMAIN: techradar.com\nSLUG: quordle-today-answers-clues-10-june-2026\nTEXT: Quordle Daily Sequence game #1598 answers are TURBOBUDDYPATSYHUMPH. The sequence is the past 20 answers, which include VENOM, UNITE, SHIRT, ANGER from Tuesday\'s game #1597.\n\n\n',)
