ibrary-singapore-2026-fan-meeting-6173006\nTEXT: OpenAI is in talks to lease a proposed 10-gigawatt data center campus on federal land in Ohio, potentially backed by Nvidia. The 20-year lease could cost at least $500 billion to build, with the first phase expected in 2028.\n\n\n',)
