nts who planned to attend college.\n\nID: 4176720\nCREATED: 2026-06-10\nDOMAIN: nypost.com\nSLUG: baby-faced-killer-karmelo-anthony-seen-in-first-mugshot-since-murder-conviction-35-year-sentence\nTEXT: Karmelo Anthony, a teenager convicted of first-degree murder for killing high school athlete Metcalf during a dispute at a track and field meet in Frisco, Texas on April 2, 2025, has been seen in his first mugshot since the conviction. Anthony was found guilty of murder and received a 35-year sentence.\n\nID: 4175802\nCREATED: 2026-06-09\nDOMAIN: boston25news.com\nSLUG: 6pgcx2ic2a323c2246vssgbsby\nTEXT: A Texas teenager, Karmelo Anthony, has been convicted of murder for stabbing 17-year-old track athlete Austin Metcalf during a high school track meet in McKinney, Texas. The jury rejected Anthony\'s claims of self-defense during a confrontation with Metcalf in stadium bleachers last year.\n\n\n',)
