 Nayyar emphasizes the importance of barrier-free content, stating that it is essential for AI-friendliness. The platform integrates barrierefreiheit, content strategy, search and analytics in a single solution for enterprise teams. Siteimprove was founded in 2003 and is currently owned by Nordic Capital, with a presence in major global companies, governments and educational institutions.\n\n\n',)
