etadata field is not consistent, set it to null.\n   - Metadata keys:\n       - location\n       - subject_matter\n       - industry\n       - time  (represents WHEN the event occurred, not when published)\n\nReturn ONLY a JSON object with this structure:\n\n{\n  "subject": "...",\n  "predicate": "...",\n  "object": "...",\n  "metadata": {\n    "location": "... or null",\n    "subject_matter": "... or null",\n    "industry": "... or null",\n    "time": "... or null"\n  }\n}\n\nHere are the RawRecords:\n\nID: 4164167\nCREATED: 2026-06-05\nDOMAIN: thenews.com.pk\nSLUG: 1404904-marjane-satrapi-author-persepolis-dies-at-56\nTEXT: Marjane Satrapi, author of the autobiographical graphic novel Persepolis, has died at 56. French President Macron paid tribute to Satrapi, describing her as a "leading figure in French culture and an artist devoted to freedom" whose work carried a universal message. Born in Rasht, Iran in 1969, Satrapi moved to Austria as a teenager after the 1979 Iranian Revolution and later returned to Iran to study visual communications at the University of Tehran before settling in France in 1994. Her graphic novel Persepolis, first published in 2000, explored her childhood during the Iranian Revolution and the Iran-Iraq war.\n\nID: 4158605\nCREATED: 2026-06-04\nDOMAIN: deadline.com\nSLUG: marjane-satrapi-dead-iranian-french-persepolis-56-1236940629\nTEXT: Marjane Satrapi, an Iranian-born artist and director, has passed away. She had lived in France since the early 1990s after her parents sent her to Europe as a teenager to escape Iran\'s Islamic Republic regime.\n\nID: 4160595\nCREATED: 2026-06-04\nDOMAIN: ctvnews.ca\nSLUG: marjane-satrapi-french-iranian-artist-and-author-behind-persepolis-dies-at-56\nTEXT: Marjane Satrapi, a 56-year-old French-Iranian artist and author known for her graphic novel "Persepolis," has passed away.\n\n\n',)
