etadata field is not consistent, set it to null.\n   - Metadata keys:\n       - location\n       - subject_matter\n       - industry\n       - time  (represents WHEN the event occurred, not when published)\n\nReturn ONLY a JSON object with this structure:\n\n{\n  "subject": "...",\n  "predicate": "...",\n  "object": "...",\n  "metadata": {\n    "location": "... or null",\n    "subject_matter": "... or null",\n    "industry": "... or null",\n    "time": "... or null"\n  }\n}\n\nHere are the RawRecords:\n\nID: 4168250\nCREATED: 2026-06-07\nDOMAIN: japantimes.co.jp\nSLUG: india-overpass-school\nTEXT: A school operates in a row of pastel-colored shipping containers beneath an overpass in Mumbai, serving marginalized children. Despite laws guaranteeing free schooling for 6-14 year olds, poverty and migration keep many out of classrooms. Crumbling urban poverty means young children selling street goods are still common in crowded traffic intersections, such as those found in Mumbai.\n\nID: 4168676\nCREATED: 2026-06-07\nDOMAIN: channelnewsasia.com\nSLUG: india-mumbai-flyover-school-street-marginalised-children-6167231\nTEXT: A free school operates beneath a flyover in Mumbai, India, providing education to marginalised children. Despite laws guaranteeing free schooling for 6-14 year olds, poverty and migration keep many out of classrooms. The non-profit running the school aims to educate underprivileged children, many from homeless families struggling to survive on low-paying informal work.\n\n\n',)
